\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces \textsc  {DDR}{} as a function of perturbation strength $p$ on Junyi Academy for five graph augmentation families: four label-agnostic operators (\texttt  {attr\_mask}, \texttt  {subgraph}, \texttt  {edge\_drop}, \texttt  {node\_drop}) and one prerequisite-preserving operator (\texttt  {prereq\_preserve}). Each marker plots the mean \textsc  {DDR}{} averaged across nine stochastic runs (three random seeds on each of three train folds). The same ordering holds on ASSISTments~2012 and XES3G5M (Supplementary Figure~S2): $\textsc  {DDR}(\text  {attr\_mask})=0 < \textsc  {DDR}(\text  {subgraph}) \lesssim \textsc  {DDR}(\text  {prereq\_preserve}) < \textsc  {DDR}(\text  {edge\_drop}) \approx p < \textsc  {DDR}(\text  {node\_drop})$.}}{26}{figure.caption.39}\protected@file@percent }
